    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "三次審査も通過できちゃうなんて、さすが私ね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、本当にな\r\n自信があったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "さあ……？\r\nでも、やるだけのことはやったわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それで結果がついてきたんだ\r\n何も言うことはないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "次は……どうだろう？\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝宣言でもしてみるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "気が早すぎ\r\nそれで参加もできなかったら目も当てられないわ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "もちろん、最終的な目標は優勝だけど\r\n上を見すぎると足元がおろそかになるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一歩一歩、しっかり踏みしめていくってことだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050080,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうね。浮かれすぎず、ネガティブになりすぎず\r\nやれる限りのことをやる──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい心がけだな\r\nかなならきっと勝ち進めるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001050090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "だといいんだけどね\r\nとにかく全力を尽くしてみるわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200105/7802001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺も全力でサポートするからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
